§ `Sections`

§ a
    GIVEN a1 IS A BOOLEAN
§§ aa
    GIVEN a2 IS A BOOLEAN
§§§ aaa
    GIVEN a3 IS A BOOLEAN
#CHECK a.aa.a2
#CHECK b.ba.a2
#CHECK a3
#CHECK a.aa.aaa.a3

§§ ab AKA foo, bar
    GIVEN a4 IS A BOOLEAN
§§ ac AKA baz
    GIVEN a4 IS A NUMBER
§ b
    GIVEN a1 IS A BOOLEAN
§§ ba
    GIVEN a2 IS A BOOLEAN
§ c

#CHECK b.a1
#CHECK b.ba.a2
#CHECK b.ba.a2
#CHECK a.a1
